 {"text": "William Shakespeare, The Merchant of Venice", "x0": 0.3885839736553238, "y0": 0.5695415695415695, "x1": 0.6970362239297475, "y1": 0.5804195804195804}, {"text": "Drama", "x0": 0.16355653128430298, "y0": 0.5843045843045843, "x1": 0.21295279912184412, "y1": 0.5920745920745921}, {"text": "Section II prescribed texts continue on page 10", "x0": 0.2996706915477497, "y0": 0.6853146853146853, "x1": 0.6992316136114161, "y1": 0.6985236985236986}], [{"text": "Section II prescribed texts (continued)", "x0": 0.11964873765093303, "y0": 0.053613053613053616, "x1": 0.4270032930845225, "y1": 0.06682206682206682}, {"text": "Nonfiction \u2014 Tim Winton, The Boy Behind the Curtain", "x0": 0.15916575192096596, "y0": 0.08080808080808081, "x1": 0.6652030735455543, "y1": 0.10334110334110334}, {"text": "* Havoc: A Life in Accidents", "x0": 0.3896816684961581, "y0": 0.10722610722610723, "x1": 0.579582875960483, "y1": 0.11732711732711733}, {"text": "* Betsy", "x0": 0.3896816684961581, "y0": 0.12198912198912198, "x1": 0.43688254665203075, "y1": 0.1320901320901321}, {"text": "* Twice on Sundays", "x0": 0.3896816684961581, "y0": 0.13597513597513597, "x1": 0.5203073545554336, "y1": 0.1445221445221445}, {"text": "* The Wait and the Flow", "x0": 0.3896816684961581, "y0": 0.14996114996114995, "x1": 0.5521405049396267, "y1": 0.15773115773115773}, {"text": "* In the Shadow of the Hospital", "x0": 0.3896816684961581, "y0": 0.16472416472416473, "x1": 0.6004390779363337, "y1": 0.17482517482517482}, {"text": "* The Demon Shark", "x0": 0.3896816684961581, "y0": 0.17871017871017872, "x1": 0.5214050493962679, "y1": 0.1864801864801865}, {"text": "* Barefoot in the Temple of Art", "x0": 0.3896816684961581, "y0": 0.1926961926961927, "x1": 0.5949506037321625, "y1": 0.20279720279720279}, {"text": "Malala Yousafzai and Christina Lamb, Jam Malala", "x0": 0.3885839736553238, "y0": 0.2128982128982129, "x1": 0.7332601536772777, "y1": 0.2222222222222222}, {"text": "Film \u2014 Stephen Daldry, Billy Elliot", "x0": 0.16355653128430298, "y0": 0.2540792540792541, "x1": 0.5729967069154775, "y1": 0.26495726495726496}, {"text": "Media \u2014 Ivan", "x0": 0.16355653128430298, "y0": 0.289044289044289, "x1": 0.41712403951701427, "y1": 0.3108003108003108}, {"text": "* Go Back to Where You Came From", "x0": 0.3896816684961581, "y0": 0.31546231546231546, "x1": 0.6355653128430296, "y1": 0.32400932400932403}, {"text": "\u2014 Series 1: Episodes 1, 2 and 3", "x0": 0.3885839736553238, "y0": 0.32944832944832947, "x1": 0.5927552140504939, "y1": 0.34032634032634035}, {"text": "and", "x0": 0.3885839736553238, "y0": 0.3434343434343434, "x1": 0.411635565312843, "y1": 0.35120435120435123}, {"text": "* The Response", "x0": 0.3896816684961581, "y0": 0.35664335664335667, "x1": 0.49396267837541163, "y1": 0.36752136752136755}, {"text": "\u2014 Lucy Walker, Waste Land", "x0": 0.3534577387486279, "y0": 0.37684537684537683, "x1": 0.5609220636663008, "y1": 0.3877233877233877}, {"text": "End of paper", "x0": 0.4434687156970362, "y0": 0.4630924630924631, "x1": 0.5554335894621295, "y1": 0.4763014763014763}, {"text": "10", "x0": 0.49286498353457736, "y0": 0.9549339549339549, "x1": 0.5071350164654226, "y1": 0.9634809634809635}], [{"text": "Cheltenham Girls\u2019 High School", "x0": 0.1207464324917673, "y0": 0.2905982905982906, "x1": 0.4445664105378705, "y1": 0.30691530691530694}, {"text": "HIGHER,", "x0": 0.31284302963776073, "y0": 0.34654234654234656, "x1": 0.3754116355653128, "y1": 0.35664335664335667}, {"text": "SCHOOL", "x0": 0.31284302963776073, "y0": 0.36363636363636365, "x1": 0.3809001097694841, "y1": 0.3745143745143745}, {"text": "2022", "x0": 0.13391877058177826, "y0": 0.3667443667443667, "x1": 0.2414928649835346, "y1": 0.39316239316239315}, {"text": "CERTIFICATE", "x0": 0.31174533479692645, "y0": 0.38073038073038074, "x1": 0.41712403951701427, "y1": 0.3916083916083916}, {"text": "TRIAL EXAMINATION", "x0": 0.31174533479692645, "y0": 0.3978243978243978, "x1": 0.4774972557628979, "y1": 0.4087024087024087}, {"text": "English Standard", "x0": 0.12294182217343579, "y0": 0.48717948717948717, "x1": 0.5488474204171241, "y1": 0.5252525252525253}, {"text": "Paper 1 \u2014 Texts and Human Experiences", "x0": 0.12184412733260154, "y0": 0.5578865578865578, "x1": 0.8485181119648738, "y1": 0.5835275835275835}, {"text": "Stimulus Booklet for Section |", "x0": 0.1207464324917673, "y0": 0.6184926184926185, "x1": 0.5949506037321625, "y1": 0.6379176379176379}, {"text": "Text1 \u2014Website Article", "x0": 0.2864983534577388, "y0": 0.7443667443667443, "x1": 0.4961580680570801, "y1": 0.7544677544677545}, {"text": "Section |", "x0": 0.11964873765093303, "y0": 0.745920745920746, "x1": 0.18880351262349068, "y1": 0.7552447552447552}, {"text": "@ Text 2", "x0": 0.2667398463227223, "y0": 0.7793317793317793, "x1": 0.3336992316136114, "y1": 0.7886557886557887}, {"text": "@ Text 3", "x0": 0.2667398463227223, "y0": 0.8142968142968143, "x1": 0.33260153677277715, "y1": 0.8236208236208237}, {"text": "\u00a9 Text 4", "x0": 0.2667398463227223, "y0": 0.8492618492618492, "x1": 0.3336992316136114, "y1": 0.8585858585858586}, {"text": "@", "x0": 0.2667398463227223, "y0": 0.8865578865578866, "x1": 0.27552140504939626, "y1": 0.8927738927738927}], [{"text": "Section I", "x0": 0.11964873765093303, "y0": 0.06293706293706294, "x1": 0.20636663007683864, "y1": 0.07459207459207459}, {"text": "Text 1 \u2014 Website article", "x0": 0.11964873765093303, "y0": 0.10101010101010101, "x1": 0.32821075740944017, "y1": 0.11033411033411034}, {"text": "While returning by bus to England from the Black Forest in the south of Germany via", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.14918414918414918, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.1623931623931624}, {"text": "Paris, I am travelling on a night bus, and as usual, we've pulled into a large roadside", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.1655011655011655, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.17871017871017872}, {"text": "petrol station to refuel. This stop is on the outskirts of a small city called Metz in", "x0": 0.14270032930845225, "y0": 0.17404817404817405, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.20046620046620048}, {"text": "France, just over the border from Germany, in a region called Lorraine. I hear the", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.1989121989121989, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.21212121212121213}, {"text": "familiar hiss of the front doors open. \"30 minutes\", says the driver in his gruff voice", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.21522921522921523, "x1": 0.8441273326015367, "y1": 0.22843822843822845}, {"text": "with typical German efficiency. Like lemmings, we all file down the aisle of the bus", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.23154623154623155, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.24475524475524477}, {"text": "and head into the night. The cold air hits me like a slap in the face, my breath instantly", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.24786324786324787, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.26107226107226106}, {"text": "becoming a fog. I shiver and pull up my hood stepping into the light rain, the warm", "x0": 0.14270032930845225, "y0": 0.2641802641802642, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.2773892773892774}, {"text": "glow from the service station beckoning us like moths to a flame.", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.2804972804972805, "x1": 0.6673984632272228, "y1": 0.2937062937062937}, {"text": "Inside is a cafeteria like the ones you see at Ikea. I grab a plastic tray and place it on", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.31313131313131315, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.32634032634032634}, {"text": "the rail that is designed to slide along as you pass each food item to choose from. First", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.32944832944832947, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.34265734265734266}, {"text": "up is a watery grey soup with some sort of bread-like dumplings floating on top. Pass.", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.3457653457653458, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.358974358974359}, {"text": "Next is some dry pasta lightly covered with what looks like tinned corned beef. Pass.", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.35353535353535354, "x1": 0.8419319429198683, "y1": 0.37995337995337997}, {"text": "Next is potatoes in a heavy buttery cream. Pass. Next, I see there is an empty tray and", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.3791763791763792, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.3923853923853924}, {"text": "lastly is dessert, some fluorescent green and bright red jelly in plastic cups with cream", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.3954933954933955, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.4087024087024087}, {"text": "on top. I gulp, disheartened. I think to myself, I can't eat any of that, can I? Then, like", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.40326340326340326, "x1": 0.8441273326015367, "y1": 0.4296814296814297}, {"text": "an angel from heaven, I see my saving grace. She\u2019s heading towards the empty tray -", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.4281274281274281, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.44133644133644134}, {"text": "an elderly lady in a hairnet carrying a tray of what looks like freshly baked Quiche", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.4444444444444444, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.45765345765345766}, {"text": "Lorraine!", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.46153846153846156, "x1": 0.21624588364434688, "y1": 0.47086247086247085}, {"text": "\"Merci mademoiselle,\" I say cheekily as I grab two serves, which elicits a quick smile.", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.4933954933954934, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.5066045066045066}, {"text": "I pay, and when I sit down to eat the flaky crust with soft cheesy goodness, I'm", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.5097125097125097, "x1": 0.8430296377607025, "y1": 0.5229215229215229}, {"text": "suddenly full of gratitude, as I realise I had just found the diamond in the rough.", "x0": 0.1437980241492865, "y0": 0.526029526029526, "x1": 0.7859495060373216, "y1": 0.5392385392385393}, {"text": "DYLAN GITTOES", "x0": 0.6915477497255763, "y0": 0.5578865578865578, "x1": 0.8441273326015367, "y1": 0.5672105672105672}, {"text": "Introduction to Quiche Lorraine post", "x0": 0.5290889132821076, "y0": 0.5726495726495726, "x1": 0.845225027442371, "y1": 0.585081585081585}], [{"text": "Text 2 \u2014 Prose fiction extract", "x0": 0.11964873765093303, "y0": 0.06293706293706294, "x1": 0.3743139407244786, "y1": 0.07226107226107226}, {"text": "After about a year together she realized that loving him was not good for her", "x0": 0.19099890230515917, "y0": 0.10878010878010878, "x1": 0.8320526893523601, "y1": 0.12198912198912198}, {"text": "but it took another year for her to end it and now she was very glad that it was", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.1258741258741259, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.13908313908313907}, {"text": "over.", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.1452991452991453, "x1": 0.2052689352360044, "y1": 0.1522921522921523}, {"text": "Sometimes she wondered how she had allowed it to go on for such a long time.", "x0": 0.19209659714599342, "y0": 0.1655011655011655, "x1": 0.827661909989023, "y1": 0.17871017871017872}, {"text": "I will be very careful the next time I fall in love, she told herself. Also, she had", "x0": 0.19099890230515917, "y0": 0.1888111888111888, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.20202020202020202}, {"text": "made a promise to herself that she intended on keeping. She was never going to", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.20512820512820512, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.21833721833721834}, {"text": "go out with another writer: no matter how charming, sensitive, inventive or fun", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.22144522144522144, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.23465423465423466}, {"text": "they could be. They weren\u2019t worth it in the long run. They were emotionally too", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.23776223776223776, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.25097125097125095}, {"text": "expensive and the upkeep was complicated. They were like having a vacuum", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.2540792540792541, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.26728826728826727}, {"text": "cleaner around the house that broke all the time and only Einstein could fix it.", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.27117327117327117, "x1": 0.7914379802414928, "y1": 0.28438228438228436}, {"text": "She wanted her next lover to be a broom.", "x0": 0.19209659714599342, "y0": 0.29448329448329447, "x1": 0.5203073545554336, "y1": 0.3045843045843046}, {"text": "RICHARD BRAUTIGAN", "x0": 0.6070252469813392, "y0": 0.3278943278943279, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.337995337995338}, {"text": "Sombrero Fallout", "x0": 0.6695938529088913, "y0": 0.3442113442113442, "x1": 0.8331503841931943, "y1": 0.3543123543123543}], [{"text": "Text 3 \u2014 Nonfiction extract", "x0": 0.11964873765093303, "y0": 0.06293706293706294, "x1": 0.3567508232711306, "y1": 0.07226107226107226}, {"text": "Question: Why must we lie?", "x0": 0.16794731064763996, "y0": 0.1111111111111111, "x1": 0.3918770581778266, "y1": 0.12432012432012432}, {"text": "If we put lying into the broader category of deceit (including deceptions) we see", "x0": 0.16794731064763996, "y0": 0.14219114219114218, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.1554001554001554}, {"text": "this is a very normal part of nature - human nature, animal nature, even plant", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.1585081585081585, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.1717171717171717}, {"text": "nature.", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.17715617715617715, "x1": 0.22063666300768386, "y1": 0.18492618492618493}, {"text": "The Pitcher Plant traps insects by deceiving them with the attraction of nectar and", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.20512820512820512, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.21833721833721834}, {"text": "then, they fall in and are doomed. Weak animals can blend in with their", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.22144522144522144, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.23465423465423466}, {"text": "background. Others are bright, boldly patterned and coloured to try to scare", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.23776223776223776, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.25097125097125095}, {"text": "predators or, even attract a mate. These are all various forms of deception. So, one", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.2540792540792541, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.26728826728826727}, {"text": "key attribute of life in nature is deceit.", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.2680652680652681, "x1": 0.47310647639956094, "y1": 0.28826728826728826}, {"text": "We humans can see how normal and everyday this is. Women wear makeup, guys", "x0": 0.16794731064763996, "y0": 0.3014763014763015, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.3146853146853147}, {"text": "drive muscular cars (me included) and we don\u2019t get alarmed... It\u2019s normal.", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.3177933177933178, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.331002331002331}, {"text": "Pragmatically, these deceptions work. Most often, we know why they work - that", "x0": 0.16794731064763996, "y0": 0.3341103341103341, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.3473193473193473}, {"text": "they are either attractants or repellents...usually on purpose, sometimes", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.3504273504273504, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.36363636363636365}, {"text": "accidentally. Modern advertising uses these lying tricks all the time, of course.", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.3667443667443667, "x1": 0.7969264544456641, "y1": 0.37995337995337997}, {"text": "But is lying \u2018good\u2019? In a godly sense, no. These deceptions are not all good and", "x0": 0.16794731064763996, "y0": 0.3978243978243978, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.411033411033411}, {"text": "therefore, we use the rather ugly word \u2018evil\u2019. But they are evils? (boy, could I get", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.41414141414141414, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.42735042735042733}, {"text": "some nasty replies on that!) But being outraged because we were told a lie, or see", "x0": 0.16794731064763996, "y0": 0.43045843045843046, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.44366744366744365}, {"text": "politicians use dishonesty, is pretty surprising to me. We surely are not that naive", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.4467754467754468, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.45998445998445997}, {"text": "to miss all the deceits around us including those we use ourselves. I think we", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.4630924630924631, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.4763014763014763}, {"text": "realise they are part of all life.", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.4716394716394716, "x1": 0.407244785949506, "y1": 0.49572649572649574}, {"text": "However, when we hold politicians or our leaders to being better than most of us,", "x0": 0.16794731064763996, "y0": 0.5104895104895105, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.5236985236985237}, {"text": "that is a \u2018good\u2019 thing. Good as in godly good. When we want a higher standard", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.5268065268065268, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.54001554001554}, {"text": "from others (or within ourselves) we are actually giving a hug to goodness (even", "x0": 0.16794731064763996, "y0": 0.5431235431235432, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.5563325563325563}, {"text": "God). We are aligning ourselves with a supernatural goodness - something better", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.5594405594405595, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.5726495726495726}, {"text": "and more ideal than the experience of our mortal lives.", "x0": 0.1668496158068057, "y0": 0.5672105672105672, "x1": 0.605927552140505, "y1": 0.5936285936285937}, {"text": "Adapted from and with thanks to.", "x0": 0.6070252469813392, "y0": 0.6083916083916084, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.6192696192696193}, {"text": "M. EARS", "x0": 0.7596048298572997, "y0": 0.6223776223776224, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.6309246309246309}], [{"text": "Text 4 \u2014 Advertisement", "x0": 0.12184412733260154, "y0": 0.08935508935508936, "x1": 0.32821075740944017, "y1": 0.09867909867909867}], [], [{"text": "Text 5 \u2014 Prose fiction extract", "x0": 0.12184412733260154, "y0": 0.08935508935508936, "x1": 0.3754116355653128, "y1": 0.09867909867909867}, {"text": "The beasts drew ever near, and the Elite soldier needed a plan. Much like the", "x0": 0.15587266739846323, "y0": 0.1452991452991453, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.1585081585081585}, {"text": "gentlest of breezes on a still summer day. The lightest glimmer of possibility soon", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.15306915306915306, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.1794871794871795}, {"text": "becomes a sound plan. He now had one. It was reckless. It was dangerous. It was", "x0": 0.15587266739846323, "y0": 0.17793317793317792, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.19114219114219114}, {"text": "dumb.", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.19425019425019424, "x1": 0.2052689352360044, "y1": 0.20435120435120435}, {"text": "Yet it was still more palatable* than getting into a firefight with some large beasts", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.21756021756021757, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.23076923076923078}, {"text": "that would tear his limbs from their sockets with their big gnashing teeth. This was", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.2338772338772339, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.24708624708624707}, {"text": "going to have to work.", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.2501942501942502, "x1": 0.3358946212952799, "y1": 0.2634032634032634}, {"text": "He took his jetpack off, and quickly inspected it. The plasma-core was only about", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.27350427350427353, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.2867132867132867}, {"text": "two percent capacity; it was only intended to get him to the surface. only kept", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.2905982905982906, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.3038073038073038}, {"text": "it on as it was shielding his back from the heat but what if he used the power-core", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.30691530691530694, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.3201243201243201}, {"text": "from the plasma- rifle to power the jetpack? One huge thrust- flying uncontrollably", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.32323232323232326, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.33644133644133645}, {"text": "across the valley floor, and hopefully into the cave on the other side? It was the", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.3395493395493395, "x1": 0.827661909989023, "y1": 0.35275835275835277}, {"text": "only plan on offer so he quickly got to work in pulling apart his weapon.", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.35586635586635584, "x1": 0.7387486278814489, "y1": 0.3690753690753691}, {"text": "Twelve minutes until sundown.", "x0": 0.15587266739846323, "y0": 0.3791763791763792, "x1": 0.407244785949506, "y1": 0.38927738927738925}, {"text": "Frantically, the soldier worked and re-wired the plasma-core into the jetpack. He\u2019d", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.4024864024864025, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.4156954156954157}, {"text": "never actually done this before though some of the guys in his Sub-Unit Elite team", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.411033411033411, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.43512043512043513}, {"text": "had theorised about it.", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.43512043512043513, "x1": 0.3336992316136114, "y1": 0.44522144522144524}, {"text": "The roars were getting thunderous as he jumped to his feet. He finished strapping", "x0": 0.15587266739846323, "y0": 0.4592074592074592, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.47241647241647244}, {"text": "on the jetpack, just as the first of the beasts came clambering out of the darkness.", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.4755244755244755, "x1": 0.827661909989023, "y1": 0.4887334887334887}, {"text": "They were large, red-scaled lizard-like creatures \u2014 creatures he\u2019d never seen", "x0": 0.15587266739846323, "y0": 0.49184149184149184, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.5050505050505051}, {"text": "before. Creatures that probably didn\u2019t live anywhere but here, and it was no", "x0": 0.15587266739846323, "y0": 0.5081585081585082, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.5213675213675214}, {"text": "wonder. How would they ever get off this forsaken rock?", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.515928515928516, "x1": 0.6136114160263447, "y1": 0.5423465423465423}, {"text": "Pressing himself into a shadow, he watched as three of them were now in the room.", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.5477855477855478, "x1": 0.827661909989023, "y1": 0.560994560994561}, {"text": "They growled, looking around wildly for what it was they could smell. The heat", "x0": 0.15587266739846323, "y0": 0.5641025641025641, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.5773115773115773}, {"text": "from outside was clouding their senses; the soldier looked down the energy", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.5804195804195804, "x1": 0.827661909989023, "y1": 0.5936285936285937}, {"text": "indicator, It wasn\u2019t quite complete, but there was no more time \u2014 it had to be", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.5975135975135976, "x1": 0.827661909989023, "y1": 0.6107226107226107}, {"text": "enough to get out of there.", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.6138306138306139, "x1": 0.36663007683863885, "y1": 0.627039627039627}, {"text": "Stepping out of the shadow into the middle of the doorway, the beasts all roared in", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.6371406371406372, "x1": 0.827661909989023, "y1": 0.6503496503496503}, {"text": "the most ear-ringing chorus, charging wildly towards him. With his eyes closed,", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.6534576534576535, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.6666666666666666}, {"text": "taking a deep breath, he dove out forward, activating the jet-pack.", "x0": 0.15697036223929747, "y0": 0.6697746697746698, "x1": 0.6838638858397366, "y1": 0.682983682983683}, {"text": "DARREN GALLAGHER", "x0": 0.6201975850713501, "y0": 0.7031857031857032, "x1": 0.8298572996706916, "y1": 0.7125097125097125}, {"text": "26 Minutes Until Sundown", "x0": 0.6147091108671789, "y0": 0.7187257187257188, "x1": 0.8287596048298573, "y1": 0.7288267288267288}, {"text": "\u201cpalatable: acceptable or satisfactory", "x0": 0.12184412733260154, "y0": 0.7544677544677545, "x1": 0.3743139407244786, "y1": 0.7653457653457654}]]